      "writtenOn": "2025-03-15T00:29:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When you say \"no fw\", do you mean no custom pvmfw, or no pvmfw at all? I think `needs_firmware_loaded() \u003d\u003d false` in crosvm means the former, simply that crosvm itself doesn\u0027t need to do the loading.\n\n\u003e We care about the offset of the payload_entry_address in the region of that guest_mem to be 0. Thats what the code is doing, right?\n\nSorry, you are right. The code at HEAD makes sense.",
      "parentUuid": "d0708eea_32e7c6d7",
